  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;&quot;&gt;The proposed development, by reason of its inappropriate layout, detailed design and insufficient information on associated repairs, fixings and necessary remediation works to bring the building into a habitable condition would fail to preserve the Grade II* Listed Building, including features of special architectural or historic interest it possesses, contrary to Policies D3 (Optimising site capacity through the Design-led approach), HC1 (Heritage and Growth) of the London Plan (2021) and Policies LP1 (Design Quality and Local Character), LP3 (Designated Heritage Assets) of the Hackney Local Plan (2020) and the NPPF (2024).&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
